<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44623" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sŏlĭdĭtas</span></b> ,
			ātis, f.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>solidness</i>, <i>solidity</i> (good prose), <i><span class="en">Cic. Fin.
				1, 6, 17</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. N. D. 1, 19, 49</span></i>; <i><span class="en">1, 38,
				105</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Univ. 5, 13</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Pall. Mai, 9,
			1</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b> (post-Aug.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Thickness</i>, <i><span class="en">Pall. 1, 6,
			9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Febr. 17, 5</span></i>.
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Solidity</i>, <i>firmness</i>, <i><span class="en">Vitr. 2,
			6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2,
			8</span></i>.— Hence, plur. concr.:
			soliditates, <i>firm</i> or <i>solid
				masses</i>, <i><span class="en">Vitr. 7, 3,
			7</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b> In
			jurid. Lat., <i>the whole</i>, <i>entirety</i> (opp. a share, part): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">possessionis, etc.,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cod. Just. 4, 52, 2</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">11, 35, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">App. Trism.
				p. 288</span></i> Bip.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hereditas universorum soliditas singulorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ambros. Psa. 118</span></i>
			, Serm. 14, 41.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
